# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Vercel deploy excludes.
#
# IMPORTANT: `vercel` CLI deploys honor THIS file, NOT .gitignore. This mirrors
# .gitignore's data/secret rules so a local `vercel deploy` can never bundle real
# client data or secrets that git already keeps out of the repo. Keep the two in
# sync. (Git-integration deploys build from the repo, so they are already safe.)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Environment & secrets — never ship real tokens/keys. Keep the tracked example.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# Client data — real discovery snapshots, per-account mappings, tag lists, and the
# AI-copywriter training spreadsheet. Keep only the non-sensitive example mapping.
/data/discovery/
/data/tags/
/data/mapping/*.csv
!/data/mapping/example.csv
*.xlsx
*.xls

# Internal docs + design mocks — local only.
/docs/
/design/
